{icon:Marker_Helltide_Chest, 2}{c_white}Rewards{/c} - Pangs of Duriel can drop Gem Fragments{if:SF_15}, Royal Gems{/if}{if:SF_13}, and{if:SF_14} Legendary{/if} Runes{/if} in Helltide.{if:SF_16}
{icon:bullet}Always includes a Legendary Rune{/if}

{icon:DivinePower_Purified, 2}{if:SF_1}{c_gray}{/if} {c_rare}Purified{/c} - {c_white}Rewards{/c} doubled. Briefly gain maximum {c_important}{u}Barrier{/u}{/c} after becoming Injured, every {c_number}[{SF_9}||]{/c} seconds.{if:SF_1}{/c}{/if}

{icon:DivinePower_Corrupted, 2}{if:SF_2}{c_gray}{/if} {c_lore}Corrupted{/c} - Pangs of Duriel ambush you more often and have a {c_number}[{SF_7}*100|%|]{/c} chance to shatter your Barriers or Fortified Life with their attacks.{if:SF_2}{/c}{/if}
